            "needId": "checklist:1",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Generic \"Psychology Career\" Content Is Usually Written",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Generic PCB content usually treats psychology as one line item next to nursing and pharmacy, without separating the medical route from the non-medical one."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Neither version explains that your Biology background is a real, stated eligibility advantage for BSc Psychology and neuropsychology - not just a vague \"science helps\" claim."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "why-different",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:2",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Stay on the Medical Route: 12th",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "You become a doctor first."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "You can prescribe medication, order and read brain scans, and admit patients - a psychologist legally cannot."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The runway is long and the seats are genuinely scarce at the postgraduate stage, not just at the MBBS stage."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "the-fork",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "needId": "chain:8",
            "type": "chain",
            "heading": "Choosing Mbbs-Psychiatry Only Because",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Picking Clinical Psychology as a \"softer\" fallback from a failed NEET attempt."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Assuming every psychology-adjacent career needs RCI registration."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Ignoring the BSc Psychology route because \"Psychology sounds like an Arts subject\"."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Comparing psychiatry and psychology pay using one number from either side."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "mistakes",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 8
          }
        ]
